   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EU Twinning Lantm&#xE4;teriet Moldavien fas 1a</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Lantm&#xE4;teriet ans&#xF6;ker om st&#xF6;d till full kostnadst&#xE4;ckning i genomf&#xF6;rande av sonderingsmission inf&#xF6;r publicering av f&#xF6;r myndigheten relevant Twinningfiche. Sonderingsmission genomf&#xF6;rs f&#xF6;r att skapa b&#xE4;ttre f&#xF6;ruts&#xE4;ttningar f&#xF6;r att vinna projektet i konkurrens med andra medlemsstater i EU.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lantm&#xE4;teriet applies for support for full cost coverage in the implementation of exploration missions prior to the publication of the relevant Twinningfiche for the Authority. The exploration mission is implemented to create better conditions for winning the project in competition with other EU Member States.</narrative>
  </description>
